0..69 Comment "// The checker refuses the laws on terms of a category with families."
70..145 Comment "// Huang and Angiuli state these laws (_Fat cell structures and generalized"
146..211 Comment "// algebraic theories_, doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.LICS.2026.58, § 1.1)."
212..214 Comment "//"
215..289 Comment "// A law on terms relates two sides whose sorts agree only modulo a law on"
290..366 Comment "// types. The sort of `subTm(t, id(g))` is `Tm(g, subTy(a, id(g)))`, and the"
367..396 Comment "// sort of `t` is `Tm(g, a)`."
397..399 Comment "//"
400..474 Comment "// The reading carries an index only as a variable or an operation without"
475..548 Comment "// indices of its own. The index `subTy(a, id(g))` applies `subTy`, which"
549..579 Comment "// carries the context of `a`."
580..582 Comment "//"
583..598 Comment "// - see: #5042"
